{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1789662238000-b89043", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "车间安全培训的签到和学时怎么管理省事？", "id": "959af18fa21348d69aa542200de57af9", "created_at": "2026-09-17T16:23:58", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "94a5de56393046f1a58a3441dd969f51", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T16:23:58", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "9fa67e52796242bf883a7877c416059f", "created_at": "2026-09-17T16:24:06", "finished_at": "2026-09-17T16:24:48"}, {"type": "text", "text": "最省事的组合：企微「培训打卡」——现场放二维码，进出场各扫一次自动计时；学时台账月度导出，一人一行：培训名称/日期/应到学时/实到学时/补训状态。缺学时的人自动进下期补训名单。", "id": "0d6f29c71c134c38b13ec174c01f97ea", "created_at": "2026-09-17T16:24:06", "finished_at": "2026-09-17T16:24:48"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "dc7e215365bc4896910f3cae3fb37858", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T16:24:06", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-17T16:24:48", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "补训没赶上的人怎么处理？", "id": "dcb7ac5a87f64fad8d21c35612ff20fb", "created_at": "2026-09-17T16:28:48", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "7c59ca01c95d471d869b61a82c28417f", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T16:28:48", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "00fce76c1fa146ae853ec19aebb1bd48", "created_at": "2026-09-17T16:28:54", "finished_at": "2026-09-17T16:29:28"}, {"type": "text", "text": "进入下期补训名单并暂停独立上岗（配导师同行）；两次缺训的上报部门负责人纳入月度考核。安全培训不打卡=没培训，出事就是管理责任。", "id": "4ced9d8398d44a38b2297fdad502e9fe", "created_at": "2026-09-17T16:28:54", "finished_at": "2026-09-17T16:29:28"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "314cf6d322b643218f26fa6e103929b1", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T16:28:54", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-17T16:29:28", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}